      <Xref identifier="Q2PGG3" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="150" centerY="215" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">A cDNA clone was isolated from |FRAME: TAX-3702| and recombinantly expressed in E.coli. The functional protein encoded was shown to be a serine racemase. Specific activities of racemization of |FRAME: SER| to |FRAME: D-SERINE| and dehydration of |FRAME: SER| to |FRAME: PYRUVATE| were demonstrated, indicating that it is a bifunctional enzyme |CITS: [16483618]|</Comment>
